    )

Structured routing is easier to test than relying entirely on free-form model output.

A destructive action should not be executed solely because the model generated it.

A safer design separates proposal from execution:

if action == "delete_file":
    proposal = {
        "action": "delete_file",
        "path": file_path
    }

    return request_approval(proposal)

Validate the path and permissions, show the proposed action to the authorized user, and execute it only after the required approval. Important actions should also be logged.
